       <string>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rendering Preferences&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Control shading, stud geometry, selection appearance, edges, and step effects. Some options are unavailable when the graphics system does not support them.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
