             <string>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Highlight Style&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Choose how selected parts and parts added in the current step are highlighted in the viewport. Outline uses fading outlines in the selection, focus, or new-part highlight color. Selected parts also receive a faint fill over obscured portions. Tint and Edges uses tinted faces and colored edges for selection, and colored edges for new parts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;New-part highlighting requires Highlight New Parts. Wireframe views, image exports, and systems without outline support use Tint and Edges.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
