                 <string>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Sequence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click here and press the key combination you want to assign. Function keys, including F1, are recorded as shortcut candidates in this field. Use the Help button for guidance. Assign asks before replacing a shortcut already used by another command.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
